WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.733 --> 00:00:04.933
 hey, have you found a partner for the Yule Ball?

00:00:05.266 --> 00:00:06.900
no. not yet.

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:12.900
how about going with me?

00:00:16.233 --> 00:00:18.100
uh.. wh..what?

00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:19.666
you're a champion.

00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:21.233
you need a partner for the ball.

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:22.766
I could go with you.

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:24.133
as a friend.

00:00:24.966 --> 00:00:26.700
um.. I.. well.

00:00:30.466 --> 00:00:31.600
you two look good together.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.333
I'll leave you to it.

00:00:36.066 --> 00:00:36.666
Malfoy!

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.500
what are you doing?!

00:01:04.666 --> 00:01:06.100
a thank you would be nice.

00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:08.400
what did snakes ever do to you?

00:01:10.466 --> 00:01:11.400
it could be venomous.

00:01:11.766 --> 00:01:13.300
it doesn't belong here.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:16.600
It`s venom is there to protect it!

00:01:17.066 --> 00:01:19.000
I've never read that in any book.

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:21.233
such creatures are best left in the shadows.

00:01:22.366 --> 00:01:23.500
you should go Malfoy.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:25.166
Harry and Ron will be here soon.

00:01:35.633 --> 00:01:36.433
Malfoy!

00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:38.833
Malfoy!

00:01:41.866 --> 00:01:42.866
were you crying?

00:01:43.666 --> 00:01:45.400
are you going to the ball with Hermione?

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:46.900
I want to go with you.

00:01:47.466 --> 00:01:48.800
I already said no.

00:01:49.233 --> 00:01:52.066
no more excuses tell me how you really feel.

00:01:52.566 --> 00:01:55.733
you keep pushing me away then why did you save me?

00:01:55.733 --> 00:01:57.033
did I imagine it all?

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:01.200
don't get the wrong idea it meant nothing.

00:02:03.066 --> 00:02:03.866
okay.

00:02:06.466 --> 00:02:07.466
why?

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:11.166
I love you.

00:02:24.933 --> 00:02:26.966
yes, exactly!

00:02:29.533 --> 00:02:31.166
do you know what I'm doing Moody?

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.366
at last everything is ready for the Dark Lord!

